  "label": "Environmental Pollution",
  "description": "The concept of environmental pollution, particularly plastic waste accumulation in coastal areas, is a real-world global issue. This meme references the widespread problem of marine and land pollution caused by human waste, especially plastic, which harms ecosystems and wildlife. Understanding this requires knowledge of environmental science, global waste management systems, and the impact of consumerism on the planet.",
